    "detailed_description": "Let your ADHD loose and push gems off the Arena to accumulate points!, get the highest score you can by lasting as long as you can, every gem that falls to the center of the Arena will damage you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSome runs can get interrupted, that's why you can quit the game and pick back up where you left last time! no pressures.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEvery three months a new season will drop, bringing new game feel/mechanics and shapes to keep it fresh, new rewards for the top 20 players in the global rankings and new content for all players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSide note: This is the first game I've ever finished, I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I did making it :)",
